window.products.push({"id":675121,"name":"Sunmaki Professional Induction Cooktop, Commercial Induction Cooktop with LCD Screen & Sensor Touch,Sustainable Heating,Stainless Steel Induction Burn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71We148sW1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️PORTABLE INDUCTION BURNER: Sunmaki professional countertop burner uses 120V electrical outlet--standard in all North American homes.It has a high power of 1800w, coupled with a large coil design, heating faster and more uniformly, it is very suitable for grilling, frying steak, boiled milk and other cooking that requires a strong heating uniformity.Manufactured for reliable and durable performance in commercial and professional settings such as restaurants ☑️SENSOR TOUCH PANEL WITH LCD SCREEN:The sensor touch panel is sensitive to touch and easy to operate. The Commercial Induction Cooktop has a large LCD reading display, which can be easily viewed even from a distance. Power and temperature can be switched freely, with 18 power options from 100W to 1800W, and 21 temperature settings ranging from 104°F to 464°F. The built-in countdown digital timer can be programmed up to 12 hours. ☑️88 POUNDS LOAD CAPACITY:The shape of the Sunmaki induction cooktop is designed with heavy-duty stainless steel structure, so it can withstand a weight of 88 pounds, ensuring durability and reliability. The stainless steel panel is easy to clean, just wipe it with a wet towel. ☑️Stable Heating:Compared with the previous induction cooker, Sunmaki induction burner can be heated continuously at low power, and will not work for a period of time under low power working conditions and stop for a period of time. Overheating protection and pot detection can also ensure your cooking safety. It is also upgraded to two cooling fans, which can dissipate heat faster and protect cooking for a long time. ☑️COMPATIBLE COOKWARE:This electric burner is Compatible for induction ready cookware such as steel or cast iron, enameled iron, stainless steel, flat-bottom pan/pot. There is a magnet in the package, that can be used to test whether the cookware is compatible. If you need operation or troubleshooting guidance, as well as one-stop consumables and accessories, and bar equipment problems, please feel free to contact us by email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71We148sW1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunmaki","source_asin":"B08FDP66TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FDP66TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FDP66TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
