window.products.push({"id":675147,"name":"COSYLAND Pestle and Mortar Set Both Ends Usable, 6.2 inch 18.6 Oz 2.3 Cup Large Capacity, 2 Silicone Cover Included, Pill Crusher Spice Grinder, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e2zgfT16L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Mortar - Compared to the old one, this new mortar is bigger and heavier, more stable and won't move easily while you use it. Both Ends Usable – Different with other mortar and pestle sets, our mortars and pestles have all been designed to be used double-sided. Which means you can prepare two ingredients or spices with this set at the same time. By the way, COSYLAND Pestle and Mortar does the absolute best job with pesto, guacamole, flavored salts and the like. 2 Silicone Covers Included – We provide silicone covers for both sides; the upper larger silicone cover stops the contents from spilling out. The bottom cover avoids possible scratches between the mortar and your furniture’s surface. Heavy Duty and Convenient – Good mortar and pestle materials must be hard enough to crush the substance rather than be worn away by it. So it is with our mortar and pestle set. 2.3 cup capacity can meet all your grinding needs. Easy to Use and to Clean – Cosyland mortar and pestle can be easily cleaned with water. It’s better to rinse in running warm water immediately after use to minimize staining, and then air dry. Blenders and food processors are efficient, but nothing can beat the pleasure of grinding by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e2zgfT16L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSYLAND","source_asin":"B0872SQK8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0872SQK8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0872SQK8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
