window.products.push({"id":675376,"name":"JYPLKCMT Sailor Moon Gifts for Anime Fans | Sailor Moon Anime Wooden Hand Crank Music Box | Gifts for Sister/Daughter/Kids | Gifts for Mother’s Day Bi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RKB1nxa6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Sailor Moon: Usagi Tsukino, better known as Sailor Moon ,She is a carefree schoolgirl who can transform into Sailor Moon, the de facto leader of the Sailor Soldiers. In Sailor Moon, Usagi meets Luna, a magical talking black cat that is searching for the Moon Princess.  Luna reveals that Usagi is destined to save Earth from the forces of evil and gives her a brooch to transform into Sailor Moon.  She asks Usagi to form the Sailor Soldiers, find their princess and protect the \"Silver Crystal\".  As Usagi matures, she becomes a powerful warrior and protects her adopted home planet, Earth, from villains who wish to harm it.  Usagi is depicted as usually carefree and cheerful, but with cry-baby tendencies that show themselves when things don't go her way... Specification: √ Shape: Square √ Movement Tone Number: 18 Tones √ Material: Wood √ Type: Hand- operated √ Function: With Snowflake √ Music Boxes Shape: Hand-operated √ Music theme: Sailor Moon Theme Tune √ Type: Hand Crank √ Material: Pinewood and Metal √ Weight: 50g √ Products Size: 65x53x37mm (2.56\"x2.09\"x1.46\") Packaging Includes: √ 1 * Engraved Colorful Wooden Music Box √ 1 * Silicone Sailor Moon Keychain Warm Tips: Please attention:Hand crank, no need battery, no need electricity.  Please do not place the product near high temperature objects or fire sources. Please do not leave the product in a humid environment for a long time to avoid metal corrosion in the product. OUR SERVICE:  Our Hand Crank Musical Box,30-DAY MONEY-BACK guarantee for any reason and friendly helpful customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RKB1nxa6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JYPLKCMT","source_asin":"B08SWD4QRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SWD4QRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SWD4QRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
