window.products.push({"id":675384,"name":"Bundle of Egg Sushi Rice Mold and Vegetable Cutter Shapes Set, 6 Sets of Rice Mold and 8 Pieces Fruit Cookie Cutter Mould Cake Cheese Stamps Cute Bent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ApvwQSbmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This bundle pack of cartoon molds and shape cutters are so cute. They will make your meal more attractive, popular and delicious among your kids, family and friends. How to use them? Let’s start your gourmet tour. Sushi Rice (with cartoon mould) 1. Unfold the case. 2. Fill the inner case with rice and press it firmly. 3. Fold the outer case and press it firmly. 4. Push inner case out from back 5. Take out the Sushi Rice Roll.softly Creative Boiled Egg (with cartoon mould) 1. Strongly recommend to use eggs that with size larger than the inner case. 2, Boil the egg with water, when it’s boiled and hot, take it out, peel it, then put it inside the mould. 3, Close the cap slowly and tightly. 4, Prepare some cold water and put the mold in and wait about 10 minutes. 5. Open the cap and take out the egg., you get your cute cartoon egg Shape Vegetable and Fruit (with vegetable cutter) 1, Cut the vegetable or fruit you like (carrot, cucumber, kivi, apple, etc.) into slices 2, Choose the shape you want and mount the protective casing 3, Put the cutter above the slices and press it with your palm Package include: 6 x Sushi Boil Egg Molds 4 x Vegetable Cutters (big) 4 x Vegetable Cutters (small) 2 x Protective Cases Now, decorate your meal with the cute eggs and shaped vegetables and fruits, no one will say no to such beautiful food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ApvwQSbmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toner Depot","source_asin":"B072YWKPZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072YWKPZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072YWKPZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
