window.products.push({"id":675391,"name":"SquarePie Lunch Bag Insulated Leakproof Lunch Box for Women/Men Resuable Portable Cooler Thermal Lunch Tote Bag for Work Picnic, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FreIh2ZJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size and Wide Open Design: This lunch tote bag measures 9.4x5.3x7.9 inches. The opening of the lunch bag is wide to quickly put in and remove items. Suitable for on-the-go meals at daily use, office, shool, picnic,road trips and more. Large Capacity: Lunch bag adopts a double zipper closure design with a zippered back pocket and two open side pockets with expandable magnetic buckles on the sides. The unique design provides enough space to hold lunchboxes, fruits, drinks and snacks, and also provides better storage space for mobile phones, tablewares,or other small stuffs you daily needs. Triple Insulation: Lunch box features three layers of insulation, which can effectively lock in temperature and keep food cold/warm/fresh for hours, making the delicious for a long time. The lining is lined with eco-friendly aluminum foil, filled with thickened insulated pearl cotton on the inside, and waterproof Oxford cloth on the outside. Leak-Proof and Water-Restant: Food grade aluminum foil layer insulation and freshness, easy to clean. If the sauce is spilled inside, simply wipe it with a damp cloth or napkin. High-quality waterproof polyester fabric can protect your lunch and the items inside from rain. Fashion Design Concept: The stylish, lightweight and portable lunch bag is designed as a versatile tote bag, which can be used not only as a daily hand bag, but also as lunch bag, picnic bag, sundry bag or shopping bag. The fashionable design makes lunch bag an ideal gift for women.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FreIh2ZJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SquarePie","source_asin":"B09WV82HP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WV82HP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WV82HP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
