window.products.push({"id":675626,"name":"[ 4 Pack ] Glass Cups Set - 24oz Mason Jar Drinking Glasses with Bamboo Lids & Straws & 2 Airtight Lids & 2 hole Lids - Cute Reusable Boba Bottle, Ice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710wCU6w35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【GREAT VALUE PACK】 Mason Jar Drinking Glasses set includes 4 counts 24 ounces mason jar drinking glasses [diameter - 3.4\", height - 7.2\"], 4 nature bamboo lids, 4 reusable stainless steel straws and 2 white Lids with hole, 2 airtight white Lids with seal silicone and 2 cleaning brushes, classic design, very practical combination set. All accessories essential are provided in this pack, no need of other purchases. ✔【DURABLE & SAFE】 The mason jar drinking glasses are made of high-quality durable clear glass, Lead-free and BPA-free, PVC-free meet Food-Grade material safety standards. This thick transparent glass is lightweight than regular glass and can withstand temperature ranges (-68°F~212°F). Dishwasher safe, Microwave safe, and Freezer safe to use with beverages, and can easily be washed and stored in your refrigerator. ✔【Widely Use】 The travel glassware Great for any occasion, any hot or cold drink. Loved by homes, kitchens, breweries, cafes, bars and restaurants. You can use it to make the perfect tea, bubble tea, soda, water, iced coffee, smoothies, juice or any other fun holiday drink. Premium Glass - Its unique shape enhances your drinking experience, highlighting the color and decoration of your beverage. ✔【Large Capacity & Easy to Clean】This Drinking glass holds 24oz/700ml of beer or iced coffee, and the stainless steel straws is reusable, you're sure to have a great drinking experience. Compared with ordinary cups, our glass are thickened, with a wide mouth design, smoother edges, and does not leave any residue. With the included cleaning brush, you can easily clean long straws. ✔【AMAZING GIFT】 This drinking glass is very stylish, beautiful and distinctive. Excellent workmanship, excellent quality, perfect for birthdays, housewarming gifts, tea sets, home bars, graduations, weddings, bachelorette parties and Christmas gifts. ✔【100% QUALITY GUARANTEE】This glass set is packaged in the heavy bubble holder and thick carton box to prevent damage while in transport. If the can-shaped glass set you received was damaged or imperfect or you are not 100% satisfied, please simply contact us, we will offer a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710wCU6w35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOHARY","source_asin":"B0BQ2G8KWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ2G8KWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ2G8KWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
