window.products.push({"id":675689,"name":"Bioworth Reusable Produce Bag,Reusable Grocery Bag,Organic Cotton Cloth Bag,Vegetable Cotton Bags for Refrigerator -Drawstring,Tare-Weight Tag,Washabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KY-N+NiYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CERTIFIED ORGANIC COTTON REUSABLE PRODUCE BAGS: Many products claim to be organic, but we have a proven track record. These bags have been certified according to Global Organic Textile Standards (GOTS) meaning they fit strict criteria in regards to the ratio of organic fibers.You're getting bags that have been certified as being only the highest quality in organic products. GUARANTEED: We're confident that we offer only the highest quality organic reusable produce bags on the market and that you'll fall in love with them the first time you use them. However if you are for some reason unsatisfied with your order we offer a quick, easy, and hassle-free 100% money back guarantee. Refrigerators are designed to dehumidify the air to prevent frost buildup. This isn't a problem for most of the things you store in your refrigerator, such as bottles of milk. However this drying-out process can be detrimental to produce such as lettuce or cucumbers, which need humidity to stay fresh. Our organic cotton muslin fruits and veggies grocery bags are just the solution you need, simply dampen them when you put produce in the refrigerator. The bag's construction means your produce will still be able to breathe, and the dampness will extend the freshness of your produce by days. SAVE EARTH BY USING REUSABLE COTTON PRODUCE BAGS: Using plastic or paper bags from grocery stores creates waste that will just end up in a landfill, so use these bags when you go shopping. They're lightweight and easy to carry, and the tare weight is displayed right on the label so your checkout experience will be quick and easy every time. STRONGER THAN FLIMSY, PLASTIC BAGS: Organic muslin grocery bags are much stronger and can hold a lot more than traditional see through plastic bags. You can go ahead and pack our muslin drawstring bags up to the brim!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KY-N+NiYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bioworth","source_asin":"B07MH5FVKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MH5FVKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MH5FVKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
