window.products.push({"id":675738,"name":"Nuovoware Grillers Garlic Press, Stainless Steel Mincer & Crusher With Silicone Roller Peeler, Easy Squeeze, Rust Proof, Dishwasher Safe, Easy Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+ssJS1B1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crafted of solid high quality stainless steel which is heavy duty and last a long life without any corrosion, it won't rust, bend, break or weaken at the joints. As a quality kitchen product, this Garlic Press is perfect for mincing both unpeeled garlic cloves and peeled garlic cloves easily and quickly in one press, help you prepare delicious healthy dishes with that special aroma but not on your hands. Garlic Press basket lets you fit a number of cloves for mincing at once, perfect for frequent and every day use. Strong ergonomic handles feel comfortable in your hands, allowing easy mincing garlic cloves under gentle pressure without any extra effort. Holes in handle for hanging storage. Easy to clean and store, 1-Year Warranty. Nuovoware Garlic Press: With this high quality Garlic Press, you can produce uniformly minced garlic in no time, no more worring about smelling like garlic cloves all day. Product Description: * High Quality: Made of premium corrosion resistant sleak stainless steel, heavy duty, robust and built to last long. Suitable for frequent and everyday use. * Good Performance: Easily mince both unpeeled garlic cloves and peeled garlic cloves. Large capacity basket holds up to two cloves of garlic making it easy to get as much minced garlic as you need. It forces the garlic through a grid of small holes with ease, excluding the skin and bitter center stem. What's left is a lighter, more delicate garlic flavor to be enjoyed in sauces, soups and casseroles. * Ergonomic Design: The large handles are shaped for comfort and to provide maximum torque with minimal effort, make squeezing a breeze, even for those with weaker grip or small hands. * Time Saving: Crush several cloves at once to help reduce preparation time. * Multifunction: Can be also used for pressing fresh peeled gingers with a squeeze of the handles. * Dishwasher Safe & Easy to Clean: Wash under running water with soap, and a damp cloth, or you can put it into the dishwasher to save your cleaning time. It is 100% dishwasher safe. Specification: Material: Stainless Steel Item Weight: 8.09 ounces Package: 1 * Nuovoware Garlic Press Note for Use: * Clean the Garlic Press before the first use and after each use. Wash it under running water by hand or with dishwasher. UPC: 782301281295","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+ssJS1B1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuovoware","source_asin":"B01MQ0LLH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-675738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MQ0LLH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MQ0LLH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
